      "blocks": {
        "p1": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Cockpit & display",
            "x": 66,
            "y": 10,
            "spec": "Integrated colour touch-screen display in the cockpit; Body Geometry grips.",
            "detail_asset": "ubc-part-cockpit.webp",
            "text": "<p>Your controls and ride info in one place: assist level, battery and navigation on the display, brakes and shifting at your fingertips.</p>"
          }
        },
        "p2": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Saddle & seatpost",
            "x": 35,
            "y": 19,
            "spec": "Bridge Sport saddle, steel rails, 155 mm.",
            "detail_asset": "ubc-part-saddle.webp",
            "text": "<p>Where your weight rests. We set height and angle during your fitting.</p>"
          }
        },
        "p3": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Battery",
            "x": 56,
            "y": 48,
            "spec": "Specialized Turbo X2 840 Wh integrated battery, side entry; 4 A charger.",
            "detail_asset": "ubc-part-battery.webp",
            "text": "<p>Integrated in the down tube. Charge it on or off the bike; we explain care and storage at pickup.</p>"
          }
        },
        "p4": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Motor",
            "x": 45,
            "y": 72,
            "spec": "Specialized 3.1 motor, 105 Nm torque, 810 W.",
            "detail_asset": "ubc-part-motor.webp",
            "text": "<p>The mid-drive motor adds power as you pedal, so it feels natural on hills and headwinds.</p>"
          }
        },
        "p5": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Cranks & chain",
            "x": 53,
            "y": 75,
            "spec": "170 mm cranks, 48T chainring with chain guard; KMC eGlide 11-speed chain.",
            "detail_asset": "ubc-part-cranks.webp",
            "text": "<p>Turn your pedalling into motion; the guard keeps trousers clean.</p>"
          }
        },
        "p6": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Suspension fork",
            "x": 74,
            "y": 36,
            "spec": "SR Suntour, 120 mm travel (100 mm size S), 34 mm stanchions, 15 mm thru-axle.",
            "detail_asset": "ubc-part-fork.webp",
            "text": "<p>Absorbs bumps from the road so the ride stays comfortable and controlled.</p>"
          }
        },
        "p7": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Disc brakes",
            "x": 81,
            "y": 70,
            "spec": "Tektro HD-T5040 4-piston calipers, 2.3 mm rotors, 5 mm pads.",
            "detail_asset": "ubc-part-brakes.webp",
            "text": "<p>Hydraulic disc brakes, front and rear, for consistent stopping in dry or wet conditions.</p>"
          }
        },
        "p8": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Drivetrain",
            "x": 18,
            "y": 70,
            "spec": "Shimano CUES 11-speed, 11–50T cassette, derailleur with Shadow Plus.",
            "detail_asset": "ubc-part-drivetrain.webp",
            "text": "<p>A wide gear range for climbs and flats. We tune it at every service.</p>"
          }
        },
        "p9": {
          "type": "point",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Rack & kickstand",
            "x": 20,
            "y": 37,
